Specification Roman Numerals

DataType RomanNumeral
Description Roman Numeral formats b
Examples: ValidValues
| Value  | IsValid | Notes                                       |
| I      | True    |                                             |
| IV     | True    |                                             |
| IX     | True    |                                             |
| XL     | True    |                                             |
| XCIX   | True    |                                             |
| MMXXIV | True    |                                             |
| IIII   | False   | I cannot be repeated more than three times. |
| VV     | False   | V cannot be repeated.                       |
| IC     | False   | I may only precede V or X.                  |
| XM     | False   | X may only precede L or C.                  |
|        |         |                                             |